00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.470
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:18.780
Dr. Eggman!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:23.410
Please help me.

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:29.420
The Chaos Emeralds were sent to this world.

00:02:30.880 --> 00:02:39.010
If we collect all seven Chaos Emeralds and cause Chaos Control again, we can return to our world.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:37.440
So Sonic caused it...

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:41.990
After ending up in this world, I finally came to my senses.

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:45.320
I want to spend the rest of my years quietly in my homeland.

00:03:53.170 --> 00:04:00.880
But Sonic won't listen to me at all. In fact, he stole the Chaos Emeralds from me!

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:06.680
He doesn’t want to collect the Emeralds to get back home.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.350
He’s having too much fun running around this world with those special legs.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:13.060
That guy…

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:18.320
Didn’t Sonic tell you anything?

00:04:18.770 --> 00:04:25.200
He must know that you need to return to your homeland as soon as possible.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:28.620
He doesn't care about his friends!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:30.830
He's not my friend!

00:04:31.450 --> 00:04:34.420
I was just about getting fed up with the way he does things.

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:38.340
You’re sure that we can return home if we have the Chaos Emeralds?

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:42.760
Definitely. Please believe this poor old man!

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.140
Okay. I’ll go settle things once and for all.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:49.930
That went well.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:56.020
Episode 5

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:56.020
Clash!! Sonic vs Knuckles

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:02.900
The Chaos Emerald looks no different than any other gem.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:05.530
But it possesses great power.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:08.740
I'm going to give it a thorough analysis.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.210
Mr. Thorndyke!

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.370
I'm determined to clean your room today.

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:21.130
What should we do? Tails, hide!

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:22.920
Where?

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.850
Oh Chris, there you are.

00:05:31.560 --> 00:05:33.350
Hi.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:39.650
Mr. Thorndyke, please leave the room.

00:05:39.650 --> 00:05:43.030
It’s going to take a while to get rid of the dust in this room.

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:49.780
Oh no.

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:54.080
How cute. Is this yours, Chris?

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:56.910
Yeah. Dad sent it to me.

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:00.330
How kind of him, as always.

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:06.880
I’m kind of hungry.

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.220
Me too.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.730
I’m sure glad she didn’t find out.

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:19.520
You can say that again.

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.360
What are they doing?

00:06:26.900 --> 00:06:29.570
Chris, what seems to be the matter?

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:33.240
Nothing really, Mr. Tanaka.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:37.540
See you...

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:46.880
Chuck! Take a break from research today and get a good night's sleep.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.470
I beg you.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.010
I have no time to sleep.

00:06:52.340 --> 00:06:54.930
I still have research to do.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:58.680
Today is Sunday. It’s a day of rest.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:00.940
You need to take better care of yourself.

00:07:01.940 --> 00:07:07.990
Fine. I’ll do as you say, so stop rushing me!

00:07:08.070 --> 00:07:09.400
I can't fall asleep in an instant!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.080
Ouch...

00:07:15.780 --> 00:07:20.540
Amy! I told you not to walk around outside on your own!

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:23.630
This is no time to be worried about things like that.

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.630
Another Chaos Emerald was found!

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:33.680
Near Silver Valley, not only has a large amount of energy been detected, but machines are also mysteriously malfunctioning.

00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:40.270
The police are investigating the connection between this event and the malfunctioning power shovel from the other day.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:42.390
It sure sounds like the Chaos Emerald. The police are investigating the connection between this event and the malfunctioning power shovel from the other day.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:47.270
Silver Valley is not too far from here. Let’s go check it out.

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:52.660
Hey Sonic, you heard, right?

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:59.580
It seems to be a beautiful place, so I’d like to go on a picnic with you, Sonic.

00:08:00.370 --> 00:08:02.080
We’re not going on a picnic.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:05.500
Yeah, it sure was beautiful.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.420
How do you know?

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:12.720
You already went there by yourself again.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:14.390
That’s why I'm sitting this out.

00:08:14.930 --> 00:08:18.720
Sonic, you idiot. Chris, let's go.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:25.440
But since Mr. Tanaka took grandpa away, we can’t use the car.

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:28.440
He sure seemed strict.

00:08:28.770 --> 00:08:29.780
What should we do?

00:08:30.440 --> 00:08:32.820
I just had an idea.

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:42.290
Those stuffed animals are really big!

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:44.500
I wonder where they sell them.

00:08:44.870 --> 00:08:47.630
Everybody’s staring.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.750
But we’re doing a pretty good job tricking them.

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.010
Don’t talk.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.010
Um, my eyes are getting dry.

00:08:57.550 --> 00:09:01.100
How cute! I want one like this!

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:08.940
I want this! I want this!

00:09:01.310 --> 00:09:03.310
Damn kid!

00:09:03.430 --> 00:09:05.390
Don’t touch me!

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:09.150
The only one who gets to touch me is Sonic.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:21.200
Talk about a kid with no manners!

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:47.980
I’ll put it here.

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:50.900
Can you see?

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:58.320
Sonic! Let’s settle things once and for all today! I’ll beat you up until you change your selfish ways!

00:09:58.950 --> 00:10:01.780
I’ll be waiting for you at Silver Valley. - Knuckles

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:07.160
After the message is delivered, this machine will automatically self-destruct.

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:19.010
The only one who would do something like this is...

00:10:24.970 --> 00:10:27.180
These sandwiches are super delicious!

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.400
Ella’s cooking is the best in the world.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:34.940
It would be even more fun if Sonic was here.

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:38.610
It doesn’t feel like the Chaos Emerald was found.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:42.530
Maybe the machines just simply malfunctioned.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.490
Perhaps we were impatient to rush out here.

00:10:46.040 --> 00:10:49.460
We have no other clues, so let’s take our time looking for it.

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.190
They fell for the trap.

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:15.860
Eggman?!

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:23.030
I see. You’re the one who leaked that news report.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:29.870
All I did was jam the local electronic signals. The press jumped to their own conclusions.

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:37.000
Humans are so easily misled.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:40.420
All we have to do is break this thing.

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:49.220
You guys stay right there and watch Sonic get defeated.

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.690
What do you mean?

00:11:54.350 --> 00:11:55.770
You'll see...

00:11:58.190 --> 00:12:01.650
He’s late! What’s taking Sonic so long!

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:05.410
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:08.080
You’re late, Sonic!

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:12.500
Sorry, I was washing my face.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:16.710
Besides, it’s such a nice day. What a nice scent.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:21.220
It makes me feel alive.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:23.510
Sonic, why you…

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:28.010
Don't get so angry. Be more cool, partner.

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:32.640
Don’t you dare call me partner! Come, Sonic!

00:12:32.810 --> 00:12:34.650
I’ll settle things with you once and for all!

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:38.520
You really insist on fighting?

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:40.820
I don't feel like it.

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:44.150
Shut up! I won’t give you the Chaos Emerald.

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.200
Give it back to me!

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:49.660
Don’t tell me you’ve been tricked again.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:38.130
Whoa!

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:55.310
C'mon.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.580
Oh, what a great view!

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:49.950
C'mon, c'mon.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.870
Why you...

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:20.940
Water! Water! Someone help!

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:29.440
Oh, it’s shallow.

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.320
What’s wrong? Are you done already?

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:36.540
I’ll settle things with you.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:45.090
All right, Knuckles! Beat that abominable hedgehog to a pulp!

00:15:45.960 --> 00:15:47.210
Sonic.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:50.470
Sheesh, Knuckles is such a blockhead!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.970
He’s being deceived by Eggman!

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:55.100
There we go.

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.390
Tails, how did you do that?

00:15:58.140 --> 00:16:00.180
All I did was unscrew the screw.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:02.310
You carry that around?

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.650
It’s just a matter of habit.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:08.110
All that's left to do is match the wiring…

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:10.240
How annoying!

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:12.450
Will you please move out of the way?

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.240
Don’t do it!

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:36.720
Don’t break it! Hey! Stop it!

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:38.560
Eggman!

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:46.150
Are you running away?

00:16:46.690 --> 00:16:48.480
Fight me!

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:50.730
That blockhead...

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:56.870
I can’t get down.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:17:00.660
It’s so smoky. Help, Sonic.

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:06.290
How dare you destroy my robot! Take this!

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:22.270
Hey guys!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:24.520
Sonic!

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:29.730
How dare you, Sonic! E-47, transform!

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:46.460
Go!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:08.480
This is a battle between Sonic and me.

00:18:09.100 --> 00:18:10.310
Stay out of it!

00:18:13.730 --> 00:18:20.990
What? It's your fault to begin with for failing to get rid of Sonic!

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:43.510
I have the kids as hostage.

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:47.560
If you want them back, bring the Chaos Emerald.

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:53.060
I thought Eggman just wanted to spend the rest of his life in peace and quiet.

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:55.400
No way.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:58.780
Which means I was…

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.070
Yes, you were.

00:19:01.360 --> 00:19:02.370
Sonic.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:10.620
You're weak against water. You can’t do anything about E-47 since it's on the other side of the lake.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.550
We'll see about that.

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:29.890
Damn!

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:31.310
Are you okay?

00:19:32.520 --> 00:19:33.650
Thank you.

00:19:37.030 --> 00:19:38.400
Sonic!

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:42.110
Stop it.

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:45.870
I just knew you’d come to save us.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:50.830
It's still moving.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:53.830
Get away from it!

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:03.300
In that case, I’ll defeat Sonic with my own hands.

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:06.260
Go, E-47.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:13.520
It's all or nothing!

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:16.480
Get a load of E-47’s power!

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:33.080
Let me end this.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:34.750
Okay.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:55.600
Be gone!

00:20:55.980 --> 00:21:00.690
You’ll pay for this!

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:21.670
Knuckles!

00:21:50.740 --> 00:21:52.200
Sonic!

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:54.910
Are you both okay?

00:21:55.210 --> 00:21:56.210
Of course.

00:21:56.210 --> 00:21:58.670
Sonic, are you really all right?

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:00.960
Yeah, no big deal. I'm alright!

00:22:04.380 --> 00:22:05.260
Knuckles.

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:17.770
You want to thank Sonic but you’re too embarrassed to do so, aren't you.

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:23.780
I bet you’re thinking that you're stupid for being so easily deceived, right?

00:22:24.320 --> 00:22:25.150
Shut up!

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:48.760
<b>Tabidatsu junbi wa dekita kai?</b>

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:48.760
<i>Are you ready to go on a journey?</i>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.010
<b>mata hitotsu asa ga kuru</b>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.010
<i>Another morning has arrived</i>

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:55.580
<b>Atarashii shatsu ni kigaete</b>

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:55.580
<i>Change into a new shirt</i>

00:22:55.580 --> 00:22:59.040
<b>Kurayami wo nukedasou</b>

00:22:55.580 --> 00:22:59.040
<i>And escape the darkness</i>

00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:02.440
<b>Nemuranai machi wa kyou mo</b>

00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:06.670
<i>The sleepless city quietly watches over you again today</i>

00:23:02.440 --> 00:23:06.670
<b>Shizuka ni tada mimamotteiru</b>

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:12.660
<b>Kimi to boku ga hajimatteyuku!</b>

00:23:09.380 --> 00:23:12.660
<i>We begin to go!</i>

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:16.240
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:19.020
<b>Tomadowanai de</b>

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:19.020
<i>Don't be bewildered</i>

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:25.940
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:25.940
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:30.930
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:30.930
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:33.820 --> 00:23:37.060
<b>Kimi to boku no sekai wo terasou</b>

00:23:33.820 --> 00:23:37.060
<i>Shine a light on our world</i>

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:40.620
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:40.620 --> 00:23:44.130
<b>Kowagaranai de</b>

00:23:40.620 --> 00:23:44.130
<i>Don't be scared</i>

00:23:44.130 --> 00:23:50.300
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:44.130 --> 00:23:50.300
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:54.660
<b>Haruka tooi michi no mukou gawa e</b>

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:54.660
<i>At the other end of the very long road</i>

00:23:54.660 --> 00:23:58.180
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:54.660 --> 00:23:58.180
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:58.180 --> 00:24:02.310
<b>Kimi to boku no mirai mitsukeyou ze</b>

00:23:58.180 --> 00:24:02.310
<i>Let's find our future</i>

00:24:30.300 --> 00:25:35.330
Fierce Battle! School Wars
